    <string name="symptom_alert_emergency">This can be a sign of an emergency. Call emergency services now.</string>
    <string name="symptom_alert_urgent">Get medical advice today: contact a doctor or an urgent medical helpline.</string>
    <string name="symptom_alert_doctor">This is worth having checked by a doctor.</string>
    <string name="symptom_self_induced">If this happens often, a doctor can help. It is common, and it can be treated.</string>
    <string name="symptom_self_induced_help">Making yourself sick can be part of an eating disorder: it is the first of the five SCOFF screening questions. Eating disorders are common and treatable, and a GP is a good place to start.</string>
